    "body": "The hive-mind capability-provisioning fix is now available for review in https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/2075.\n\nIt detects explicit plugin/Agent Skill requirements before the solver session, installs the provider into persistent per-repository Codex state, and propagates that state to direct and Docker runs. Once merged, rerun the original task through hive-mind; it should provision `superpowers@openai-curated` before Codex starts.\n\nFor a manual workaround with the current Codex CLI, run `codex plugin add superpowers@openai-curated` in the operator environment before retrying.",
